ng \"Jim Henson's Dead\"), a clip of Lynch recording \"Lullaby\" in the studio for his first album, \"A Little Bit Special\" and a short film recorded by Lynch's wife, Erin"}, "D5S1": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0329-18f19bcb27e6:d04", "start": 0, "end": 46, "text": "from the album went to benefit the foundation."}, "D5S2": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0329-18f19bcb27e6:d04", "start": 47, "end": 280, "text": "The concert film features 14 songs taken from two nights at the El Rey Theatre, and on the DVD are woven together with interview footage of Andrew chronicling seven years of living, writing, recording and touring as Jack's Mannequin."}, "D5S3": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0329-18f19bcb27e6:d04", "start": 281, "end": 351, "text": "The bonus portion of the DVD includes 9 performance-only cuts as well."}, "D5S4": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0329-18f19bcb27e6:d04", "start": 352, "end": 466, "text": "Live from the El Rey Theatre Live from the El Rey Theatre is a live music CD and DVD by the band Jack's Mannequin."}, "D5S5": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0329-18f19bcb27e6:d04", "start": 467, "end": 546, "text": "It was recorded on November 11 and November 12 of 2012 at the El Rey Theatre in"}, "D6S1": {"document_number": 6, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0329-18f19bcb27e6:d05", "start": 0, "end": 5, "text": "topic"}, "D7S1": {"document_number": 7, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0329-18f19bcb27e6:d06", "start": 0, "end": 112, "text": "disambiguation pages All disambiguation pages This page was last edited on 29 February 2024 , at 07:21 ( UTC ) ."}, "D7S2": {"document_number": 7, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0329-18f19bcb27e6:d06", "start": 113, "end": 223, "text": "Text is available under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 License ; additional terms may apply ."}, "D7S3": {"document_number": 7, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0329-18f19bcb27e6:d06", "start": 224, "end": 295, "text": "By using this site , you agree to the Terms of Use a